This software, including its source code, object code, user interfaces,
designs, documentation, schemas, fixtures, configurations, data models, and
related materials (collectively, the "Software"), is a proprietary government
project developed for the operation and presentation of the CSPH GPL
Traceability Platform.

The Software is provided for authorized governmental, regulatory, operational,
security, audit, maintenance, and approved contractor use only.

2. OWNERSHIP

DTA Innotech Lab asserts copyright and proprietary rights in the Software to
the extent authorized by the applicable government project agreement. The
