3. AUTHORIZED USE

Use of the Software is authorized only for:

a. the intended governmental or regulatory purpose;
b. authorized internal operations and administration;
c. security review, audit, compliance, and incident response;
d. authorized maintenance, support, testing, and implementation work; and
e. use by contractors or third parties under a written confidentiality,
